OL,3,GNEWSAStaff recruitment starts for
OL,4,Amigrant removal centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FStaff recruitment has begun ahead of
OL,7,Fthe planned opening of an immigration
OL,8,Fremoval centre.
OL,10,FThe Haslar Immigration Removal Centre
OL,11,F(IRC) in Gosport is currently being
OL,12,Fredeveloped to house up to 130 migrants
OL,13,Fwith no lawful right to remain in the
OL,14,FUK before they are deported.
OL,16,FA planning inquiry into plans to expand
OL,17,Fthe centre further, creating a total of
OL,18,F600 beds, is due to begin next month.
OL,19,FThe government has said the expansion
OL,20,Fis "critical to strengthen detention
OL,21,Fcapacity".
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
